<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARIAN FORINT ENDS WEAKER VS DLR, GAP WIDENS.</title>
<headline>HUNGARIAN FORINT ENDS WEAKER VS DLR, GAP WIDENS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hungarian forint closed weaker against the dollar in slack trade on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The Hungarian currency ended at 177.35 to the dollar, compared to 177.10/15 at opening.</p>
<p>The forint widened the gap that separated it from the central bank's resistance level to some 35 pips from around 25 pips at the start of trade.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
